     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation dips-bloodpressureexample</b></p><a name=\"dips-bloodpressureexample\"> </a><a name=\"hcdips-bloodpressureexample\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">version: 0; Last updated: 2014-01-30 11:35:23+0000; </p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Information Source: <a href=\"https://simplifier.net/resolve?scope=hl7.fhir.no.basis@2.1.2&amp;canonical=http://fhir.org/packages/hl7.fhir.no.basis/DIPS_ASA\">DIPS_ASA</a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationBloodpressure.html\">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Blood Pressure</a></p></div><p><b>DIPSJournalId</b>: <a href=\"DocumentReference-ako1041394.html\">DocumentReference: status = current; docStatus = final</a></p><p><b>DIPSVitalSignsLocation</b>: DIPSLocation: School (At School)</p><p><b>NoDomainVitalSignsBloodpressureBodyPosition-Extension</b>: <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/414585002\">SNOMED CT: 414585002</a> (Liggende lent mot venstre)</p><p><b>identifier</b>: <code>http://dips.no/fhir/namingsystem/externalId</code>/ExtIdentifierKal0011s1, <code>http://dips.no/fhir/namingsystem/dips-ObservationId</code>/dips-bloodpressureexample, <code>http://dips.no/fhir/namingsystem/dips-RelativeEhrUri</code>/ehr:compositions/a6a969c2-fb92-435f-93cd-f5653fceb33c::default::1/content[openEHR-EHR-OBSERVATION.blood_pressure.v2 and name/value='Blodtrykk']</p><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category vital-signs}\">Vital Signs</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 85354-9}\">BP pnl w all optional</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-cdp1000807.html\">Anonymous Patient (no stated gender), DoB Unknown ( http://dips.no/fhir/namingsystem/dips-patientid#1000807)</a></p><p><b>encounter</b>: <a href=\"Encounter-agy1002679.html\">Encounter: identifier = http://dips.no/fhir/namingsystem/dips-omsorgsepisodeid#agy1002679; status = arrived; class = ambulatory (ActCode#AMB)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2019-10-25 09:30:33+0530</p><p><b>performer</b>: </p><ul><li><a href=\"Organization-afa22.html\">Organization: identifier = urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.9038.70.3#22</a></li><li><a href=\"PractitionerRole-agb103.html\">PractitionerRole: identifier = urn:oid:1.3.6.1.4.1.9038.51.1#103</a></li></ul><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 8480-6}, {http://snomed.info/sct 4471000202106}\">Systolic blood pressure</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 123 mm[Hg]<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemm[Hg] = 'mm[Hg]')</span></p><h3>ReferenceRanges</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Low</b></td><td><b>High</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>80 mm[Hg]</td><td>120 mm[Hg]</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 8462-4}, {http://snomed.info/sct 4481000202108}\">Diastolic blood pressure</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 78 mm[Hg]<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemm[Hg] = 'mm[Hg]')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 8478-0}, {http://snomed.info/sct 4501000202102}\">Mean blood pressure</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 46 mm[Hg]<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemm[Hg] = 'mm[Hg]')</span></p></blockquote></div>"
